-- Catches the drizzle history up with schema.ts. Everything here except the data key
-- harmonisation tables (nt_data_key_merges, nt_data_key_duplicate_dismissals) also ships as
-- a manual migration (content sync, confidential label only, mobile analytics), and the data
-- key tables do too (manual_migrations/2026-11-09-add_data_key_merges.sql). So every statement
-- is idempotent: it runs on a fresh database and on one those manual migrations already
-- updated, adding only what is missing. Generated by drizzle-kit, then made idempotent.
